  "content": "\n\n![ZoomUtils](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/logo.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/README/github_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" style=\"margin: 5px 10px;\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/zoomutils\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/README/modrinth_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" style=\"margin: 5px 10px;\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zoomutils\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/README/curseforge_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\" style=\"margin: 5px 10px;\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 40px 0;\">\n  <div>\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">支援版本：</h3>\n    <img width=\"165\" height=\"84\" alt=\"Minecraft 26.1\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/README/26.1.png\"/>\n    <img width=\"165\" height=\"84\" alt=\"Minecraft 26.2\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/README/26.2.png\"/>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n流暢且可自訂的縮放模組\n\n---\n\n按住縮放鍵（預設為 `C`）即可放大。在縮放狀態下滾動滑鼠滾輪可調整縮放等級。放開按鍵即可恢復正常視角。",
